<!-- Semantic description for MoveIt: the arm as a chain of the whole-robot URDF (rd_description), so the
     planner sees the chassis, the lidars, the platform and the hand. Generated 2026-11-07 from the link list;
     the base links are "Never" among themselves and with the arm mount, the UR's own pairs come from
     ur_moveit_config's SRDF (prefixed), the baked hand is adjacent to the wrist. -->
